{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChRK3wqLKWRk3yBRPegBy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Hre9w7h3pnkcMpVy4mifQ7","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/johnmarkenriquez/.claude-personal/projects/-private-var-folders-wg-kshmq8sn7zl5m1ch85m7yvvh0000gn-T-invoice-service-o31P29/memory/invoice-number-format.md","content":"---\nname: invoice-number-format\ndescription: Decided format for printed invoice numbers (INV-YYYY-NNNNNN, zero-padded to 6 digits) and why the padding matters\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nPrinted invoice numbers use the format `INV-<year>-<sequence>`:\n- literal `INV`, a hyphen\n- four-digit year of issue, a hyphen\n- sequence number zero-padded to six digits\n\nExample: `INV-2026-000123`.\n\n**Why:** The accounting export sorts invoice numbers as text, so the zero-padding is required for correct ordering (otherwise `INV-2026-10` would sort before `INV-2026-9`).\n\n**How to apply:** Any code that formats, parses, validates or generates invoice numbers must follow this format exactly, with the year taken from the issue date and the sequence padded to six digits. Don't drop the padding. Decided 2026-11-26; no code implemented yet at that time.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":575,"cache_read_input_tokens":22027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":575,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45f4666a-f3b4-4aab-9dfe-e0a2c6dbd831","uuid":"e3b672b6-a180-48d5-8ae6-757b1f8d5bb6","timestamp":"2026-11-26T09:35:22.737Z","request_id":"req_011ChRK3wheGK1K1gTesumZv","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Hre9w7h3pnkcMpVy4mifQ7":{"file_path":"/Users/